---
{
  "name": "Omnissa Horizon 8 2603 — Horizon Agent",
  "notes": "<h4>Horizon Agent — Display Protocol & Session Notes</h4><p><em>As of June 2026 — verify against current Omnissa Horizon 8 2603 documentation before deployment.</em></p><ul><li><b>Connection modes:</b> Internal (client → agent direct), External (UAG → agent), and Tunneled (Connection Server → agent). The same display protocols apply to each enabled mode.</li>{{#if (eq (countTrue protoBlast protoPCoIP protoRDP) 0)}}<li><b>No display protocol enabled</b> — enable Blast Extreme, PCoIP, or RDP for a usable session.</li>{{/if}}<li><b>Blast Extreme:</b> 22443 TCP+UDP for internal/external; tunneled via the Blast Secure Gateway uses 22443 TCP to the agent.</li><li><b>Side channels:</b> With Blast, CDR traffic is side-channeled inside the Blast ports (22443) by default, and USB redirection can optionally be side-channeled too. Otherwise — including PCoIP and RDP sessions — CDR / MMR uses TCP 9427 and USB redirection uses TCP 32111; enable the separate-port toggles to show those flows. The port-to-feature split shown follows the ports.omnissa.com rows (9427 — CDR / MMR; 32111 — USB); current Tech Zone and Horizon Security docs describe a broader set on 9427 (Windows MMR, CDR, HTML5 MMR, Teams optimization, printer redirection, USB redirection) and describe 32111 as USB redirection and time synchronization.</li><li><b>JMS:</b> The agent registers to the Connection Server over JMS — {{#if jmsEnhanced}}enhanced security (TCP 4002 in addition to TCP 4001, default){{else}}legacy (TCP 4001 only){{/if}}.</li>{{#if unmanagedRegistration}}<li><b>Unmanaged registration:</b> TCP 389 is only required for unmanaged agent registration (e.g. an RDSH agent install without an instant-clone/linked-clone component).</li>{{/if}}<li><b>Framework channel (32111):</b> Also used by the Connection Server for agent administration such as collecting a DCT log bundle (vdmadmin -A -getDCT).</li>{{#if (or enableAppVolumesAgent enableDEM)}}<li><b>Host co-residency:</b> App Volumes Agent and Dynamic Environment Manager run on the same desktop/RDS host as the Horizon Agent. Full server-side topology is in the App Volumes & DEM diagram.</li>{{/if}}<li>References: <a href=\"https://techzone.omnissa.com/resource/network-ports-horizon-8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Network Ports in Horizon 8 (Omnissa Tech Zone)</a> and <a href=\"https://ports.omnissa.com/home/Horizon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Omnissa Ports and Protocols</a>.</li></ul>",
  "parameters": [
    { "key": "agentName", "type": "string", "label": "Agent Host Hostname", "defaultValue": "vdi01.example.com" },
    { "key": "agentIP", "type": "string", "label": "Agent Host IP", "defaultValue": "10.30.0.50" },
    { "key": "additionalComments", "type": "string", "label": "Additional Node Comments", "defaultValue": "" },
    { "key": "showFirewalls", "type": "boolean", "label": "Show Firewalls (external mode)", "defaultValue": true },

    { "key": "modeInternal", "type": "boolean", "label": "Internal — Client → Agent (direct)", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "modeExternal", "type": "boolean", "label": "External — UAG → Agent", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "modeTunneled", "type": "boolean", "label": "Tunneled — Connection Server → Agent", "defaultValue": false },

    { "key": "protoBlast", "type": "boolean", "label": "Blast Extreme (22443)", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "protoPCoIP", "type": "boolean", "label": "PCoIP (4172)", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "protoRDP", "type": "boolean", "label": "RDP (3389)", "defaultValue": false },

    { "key": "sepCDR", "type": "boolean", "label": "Separate CDR / MMR (9427)", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "sepUSB", "type": "boolean", "label": "Separate USB Redirection (32111)", "defaultValue": false },

    { "key": "jmsEnhanced", "type": "boolean", "label": "JMS Enhanced Security (4001 + 4002)", "defaultValue": true },
    { "key": "unmanagedRegistration", "type": "boolean", "label": "Unmanaged Agent Registration (389)", "defaultValue": false },

    { "key": "enableAppVolumesAgent", "type": "boolean", "label": "App Volumes Agent (443)", "defaultValue": false },
    { "key": "enableDEM", "type": "boolean", "label": "Dynamic Environment Manager (445)", "defaultValue": false },

    { "key": "includeFooterInChart", "type": "boolean", "label": "Include Footer Notes in Chart", "defaultValue": false }
  ]
}
---
graph TD
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  EXTERNAL ZONE (external mode)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if modeExternal}}
    subgraph EXT[External Network]
        CLIENT_EXT[🌐 External Horizon Client]
    end
    subgraph DMZ[DMZ]
        UAG[🛡️ Unified Access Gateway]
    end
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  FIREWALLS (external mode)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if (and modeExternal showFirewalls)}}
    FFW{🛡️ Perimeter Firewall}
    BFW{🛡️ Back-End Firewall}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  INTERNAL ZONE
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    subgraph INT[Internal Network]
        AGENT[<b>Horizon Agent</b><br/>Desktop / RDS Host<br/>{{agentName}} — {{agentIP}}{{#if additionalComments}}<br/><i>{{additionalComments}}</i>{{/if}}]
        CS[🖥️ Connection Server]
        {{#if modeInternal}}
        CLIENT_INT[💻 Internal Horizon Client]
        {{/if}}
        {{#if enableAppVolumesAgent}}
        AVMGR[📦 App Volumes Manager]
        {{/if}}
        {{#if enableDEM}}
        FILESHARES[📂 SMB / CIFS File Shares]
        {{/if}}
    end

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  FIREWALL BOUNDARY ANCHORS
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if (and modeExternal showFirewalls)}}
    CLIENT_EXT ~~~ FFW
    FFW ~~~ UAG
    UAG ~~~ BFW
    %% Anchor the back-end firewall above every internal source node so it
    %% sits on its own band between the DMZ and the Internal Network rather
    %% than level with the client/Connection Server that point into the agent.
    BFW ~~~ AGENT
    BFW ~~~ CS
    {{#if modeInternal}}
    BFW ~~~ CLIENT_INT
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  EXTERNAL — Client → UAG → Agent
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if modeExternal}}
    CLIENT_EXT -->|443 TCP — login XML-API — tunnel{{#if protoBlast}}<br/>8443 TCP+UDP Blast — or 443 port sharing{{/if}}{{#if protoPCoIP}}<br/>4172 TCP+UDP PCoIP{{/if}}| UAG
    {{#if protoBlast}}
    UAG -->|22443 TCP+UDP<br/>Blast Extreme| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoPCoIP}}
    UAG -->|4172 TCP+UDP<br/>PCoIP| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoRDP}}
    UAG -->|3389 TCP<br/>RDP| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepCDR}}
    UAG -->|9427 TCP<br/>CDR / MMR| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepUSB}}
    UAG -->|32111 TCP<br/>USB redirection| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  INTERNAL — Client → Agent (direct)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if modeInternal}}
    {{#if protoBlast}}
    CLIENT_INT -->|22443 TCP+UDP<br/>Blast Extreme| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoPCoIP}}
    CLIENT_INT -->|4172 TCP+UDP<br/>PCoIP| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoRDP}}
    CLIENT_INT -->|3389 TCP<br/>RDP| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepCDR}}
    CLIENT_INT -->|9427 TCP<br/>CDR / MMR| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepUSB}}
    CLIENT_INT -->|32111 TCP<br/>USB redirection| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  TUNNELED — Connection Server → Agent
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if modeTunneled}}
    {{#if protoBlast}}
    CS -->|22443 TCP<br/>Blast tunneled| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoPCoIP}}
    CS -->|4172 TCP+UDP<br/>PCoIP tunneled| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if protoRDP}}
    CS -->|3389 TCP<br/>RDP tunneled| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepCDR}}
    CS -->|9427 TCP<br/>CDR / MMR tunneled| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{#if sepUSB}}
    CS -->|32111 TCP<br/>USB tunneled| AGENT
    {{/if}}
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  AGENT → CS (JMS / registration)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    AGENT -->|{{#if jmsEnhanced}}4001 + 4002 TCP — JMS enhanced{{else}}4001 TCP — JMS legacy{{/if}}<br/>Agent JMS| CS
    {{#if unmanagedRegistration}}
    AGENT -.->|389 TCP<br/>Unmanaged agent registration| CS
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  APP VOLUMES & DEM (host co-residency)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if enableAppVolumesAgent}}
    AGENT -->|443 TCP — 80 if non-SSL<br/>App Volumes Agent → Manager| AVMGR
    {{/if}}
    {{#if enableDEM}}
    AGENT -->|445 TCP<br/>DEM FlexEngine — SMB shares| FILESHARES
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  FOOTER NOTES (in-diagram)
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    {{#if includeFooterInChart}}
    AGENT ~~~ NOTES
    NOTES[<b>Horizon Agent Notes</b><br/>As of June 2026<br/>Modes — {{#if modeInternal}}Internal {{/if}}{{#if modeExternal}}External {{/if}}{{#if modeTunneled}}Tunneled{{/if}}<br/>Protocols — {{#if protoBlast}}Blast 22443 {{/if}}{{#if protoPCoIP}}PCoIP 4172 {{/if}}{{#if protoRDP}}RDP 3389{{/if}}{{#if (eq (countTrue protoBlast protoPCoIP protoRDP) 0)}}none — enable Blast, PCoIP, or RDP for a usable session{{/if}}<br/>JMS — {{#if jmsEnhanced}}4001 + 4002 enhanced{{else}}4001 legacy{{/if}}{{#if sepCDR}}<br/>CDR / MMR separated — 9427{{/if}}{{#if sepUSB}}<br/>USB separated — 32111{{/if}}{{#if (or protoPCoIP protoRDP)}}<br/>CDR / MMR + USB side-channel is Blast-only — PCoIP / RDP sessions use 9427 / 32111{{/if}}{{#if unmanagedRegistration}}<br/>Unmanaged registration — 389{{/if}}<br/>Framework channel 32111 — also used by Connection Server admin / DCT log collection{{#if (or sepCDR sepUSB)}}<br/>9427 / 32111 split per ports.omnissa.com — newer docs list more features on 9427 and time sync on 32111{{/if}}]
    style NOTES fill:#263238,color:#cfd8dc,stroke:#455a64,stroke-width:1px
    {{/if}}

    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    %%  STYLES
    %% ═══════════════════════════════════════
    style AGENT fill:#1565c0,color:#fff,stroke:#0d47a1,stroke-width:2px
    style INT fill:#e8f5e9,color:#000,stroke:#2e7d32
    {{#if modeExternal}}
    style EXT fill:#eceff1,color:#000,stroke:#607d8b
    style DMZ fill:#fff3e0,color:#000,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px
    {{/if}}
    {{#if (and modeExternal showFirewalls)}}
    style FFW fill:#ffebee,color:#b71c1c,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    style BFW fill:#ffebee,color:#b71c1c,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:2px
    {{/if}}
